OL,3,ARob Brydon says he invented his own    
OL,4,Afake agent to negotiate fees           
OL,6,FRob Brydon has revealed he pretended to
OL,7,Fbe his own agent at the start of his   
OL,8,Fcareer when he was working as a TV and 
OL,9,Fradio presenter in Wales.              
OL,11,FThe actor, best known for playing      
OL,12,FStacey's Uncle Bryn in the hit sitcom  
OL,13,FGavin and Stacey, told BBC One's Graham
OL,14,FNorton Show he used to step into the   
OL,15,Frole of his fake agent to arrange      
OL,16,Fbookings for events.                   
OL,18,F"I would get asked to go and do things,
OL,19,Fand I didn't really have an agent at   
OL,20,Fthat time so I invented a guy called   
OL,21,FRichard Knight," Brydon told the show. 
